seoTitle: "WAPO Chlor On-Site Hypochlorite Electrolysis | WAPOTECH | Commercial Pool Water Treatment, New York", seoDescription: "WAPO Chlor electrolysis generates 0.6% sodium hypochlorite on site from brine, 30 to 8,500 g/h, with telemetry and a 5-year pro-rata cell warranty.",
    sourceUrls: ["https://wapotech.com/", "https://wapotec.com/solutions/waporchlor-electrolysis", "https://wapotec.com/solutions/electrolysis", "https://wapotec.com/products"], claimStatus: "partially-verified", lastVerified: "2026-09-26", ownerApproved: false,
    ownerNotes: "Added at the owner's instruction (September 2026). Research notes: Capacity range is stated inconsistently across pages (30-8,500, 30-8,600, and 60-8,500 g/h). No individual model numbers, electrical requirements, salt consumption, dimensions, or NSF/ANSI 50 or 60 listings are published. The 'up to 70% savings' figure is a manufacturer claim without published basis. A second image (alt 'WAPO Chlor Electrolysis') is at https://wapotec.com/fileadmin/_processed_/f/7/csm_csm_Elektrolyse_3ce36e0e58_86e093d210.jpeg.",
