    ownerNotes: "Added at the owner's instruction (September 2026). Research notes: The 410 Series brochure and 411 product page give different maximum heads (663 ft family vs 500 ft on the 411 page); both are recorded with sources. NSF status for the 410 Series is not stated on the fetched Pentair pages (the pool page says only 'NSF approved models available' for the combined Aurora offering); ASC's line card lists Aurora 'Aquatic, NSF 50' generally. No HP range is published for the 410 Series specifically; the 150 HP figure is the combined pool-page statement. Alternative image: /content/dam/extranet/web/nam/aurora/images/product-images/400-series/410/pentair-410-split-case-threeqtr-final-beauty-1280x1280.png (411 brand page).",
