    ownerNotes: "Added at the owner's instruction (September 2026). Research notes: The commercial product page lists only two SKUs (022012, 022034); the 2019 brochure lists a broader model family, which may not all be current. Pentair's brochure describes the pump as suited to residential pools with water features as well as commercial pools. No warranty statement found on the fetched commercial page or brochure.",
