seoTitle: "Mer-Made Modulating Float Valves (FV Series) | Mer-Made Filter | Commercial Pool Equipment, New York", seoDescription: "Mer-Made fiberglass modulating float valves for surge tanks: 4 to 12 in., ANSI 150 lb flanges, standard, inline XWB and pivot styles.",
    sourceUrls: ["https://mermade.com/product/modulating-float-valves/", "https://mermade.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2024/01/mermade-filter-modulating-float-valves.pdf", "https://mermade.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2025/06/t-11478-fv-s-or-fv-d-float-valve.pdf", "https://mermade.com/product/surge-and-balance-tanks/"], claimStatus: "verified", lastVerified: "2026-09-26", ownerApproved: false,
    ownerNotes: "Added at the owner's instruction (September 2026). Research notes: The product page states flow at full-closed is approximately 20% of maximum velocity while the brochure says 20-30% of main drain flow; both are recorded. The XWB and pivot drawings (T-11479, T-11480, T-11481) were not text-extracted, so size ranges for those styles are not confirmed; only the T-11478 standard valve sizes (4-12 in.) are verified. A 'comprehensive data sheets and charts' PDF linked in search results returned an error and was not used.",
