    ownerNotes: "Added at the owner's instruction (September 2026). Research notes: The product page says two standard overall lengths while the 2022 brochure says three standard lengths; the brochure's length column could not be mapped row-by-row to each size from the extracted text, so only the size list and the general statement are recorded. The separate FRP reducers chart PDF is image-only and was not text-extracted.",
